{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/PrimeIntellect/status/2108672479007047952","id":"2108672479007047952","text":"Over two weeks, Prime Agent orchestrated a swarm of over 2,000 agents to rewrite itself in Rust.\n\nWith 10,000+ sandboxes, 200B+ GLM-5.3 tokens, and 16,000 agent-to-agent messages, this was our largest test yet of Prime Agent’s multi-agent capabilities and our infrastructure powering these agent swarms.\n\nPrime Agent now reaches usable input ~13× faster and uses 83% less startup memory than before.","raw_text":{"text":"Over two weeks, Prime Agent orchestrated a swarm of over 2,000 agents to rewrite itself in Rust.\n\nWith 10,000+ sandboxes, 200B+ GLM-5.3 tokens, and 16,000 agent-to-agent messages, this was our largest test yet of Prime Agent’s multi-agent capabilities and our infrastructure powering these agent swarms.\n\nPrime Agent now reaches usable input ~13× faster and uses 83% less startup memory than before.","display_text_range":[0,399],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[275,298],"id":"2108672461055426560","display":"pic.x.com/EyRAo4ZSKg","original":"https://t.co/EyRAo4ZSKg","replacement":"https://x.com/PrimeIntellect/status/2108672479007047952/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"PrimeIntellect","url":"https://x.com/PrimeIntellect","id":"1274287728167915522","followers":87169,"following":49,"likes":44229,"media_count":514,"name":"Prime Intellect","description":"Open Superintelligence Factory.","raw_description":{"text":"Open Superintelligence Factory.","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1274287728167915522/1771404846","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1837605403359633411/Stj4eLIH_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sat Jun 20 10:27:30 +0000 2020","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://www.primeintellect.ai/","display_url":"primeintellect.ai"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"organization"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":181,"retweets":197,"lik